Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Paulo Cesar Sentelhas work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Paulo Cesar Sentelhas' Ties to Universidade de Santo Amaro Revealed**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 108, "end": 313, "text": "In a significant development, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed researcher Paulo Cesar Sentelhas to Universidade de Santo Amaro, a prestigious institution in Brazil."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 314, "end": 442, "text": "This revelation sheds light on Sentelhas' professional affiliations and underscores his contributions to the academic community."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 443, "end": 569, "text": "According to credible sources, Sentelhas, a respected figure in his field, was indeed employed by Universidade de Santo Amaro."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 570, "end": 710, "text": "This affiliation is corroborated by multiple sources, including academic publications, university records, and testimonials from colleagues."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 711, "end": 714, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 715, "end": 832, "text": "Maria Luiza, a colleague of Sentelhas at Universidade de Santo Amaro, confirmed his association with the institution."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 833, "end": 929, "text": "\"Paulo Cesar Sentelhas was an integral part of our research team at Universidade de Santo Amaro."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 930, "end": 1008, "text": "His expertise and dedication to his work were invaluable to our projects,\" Dr."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1009, "end": 1048, "text": "Luiza stated in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1049, "end": 1204, "text": "A review of Sentelhas' published works reveals a pattern of collaboration with Universidade de Santo Amaro researchers, further solidifying the connection."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1205, "end": 1403, "text": "A 2018 study published in the Journal of Brazilian Research, co-authored by Sentelhas and Universidade de Santo Amaro faculty members, demonstrates the depth of his involvement with the institution."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1404, "end": 1543, "text": "University records obtained through a Freedom of Information Act request also confirm Sentelhas' employment at Universidade de Santo Amaro."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1544, "end": 1689, "text": "The documents, dated between 2015 and 2018, list Sentelhas as a researcher affiliated with the university's Department of Environmental Sciences."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1690, "end": 1828, "text": "Data from the Brazilian Ministry of Education's database, which tracks academic affiliations and research output, also supports the claim."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1829, "end": 2033, "text": "According to the ministry's records, Sentelhas was affiliated with Universidade de Santo Amaro during the same period, producing several research papers and projects in collaboration with the institution."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2034, "end": 2152, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Paulo Cesar Sentelhas did, in fact, work for Universidade de Santo Amaro."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2153, "end": 2308, "text": "This revelation not only underscores Sentelhas' impressive credentials but also highlights the significance of his contributions to the academic community."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2309, "end": 2315, "text": "As Dr."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2316, "end": 2476, "text": "Luiza aptly put it, \"Paulo Cesar Sentelhas' work at Universidade de Santo Amaro has left a lasting impact on our institution and the broader research community."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 19, "end": 117, "text": "Renowned Researcher Paulo Cesar Sentelhas Reflects on Pioneering Work at Sloan-Kettering Institute"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 119, "end": 164, "text": "New York, NY - In an exclusive interview, Dr."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 165, "end": 366, "text": "Paulo Cesar Sentelhas, a distinguished researcher in the field of oncology, shared insights into his groundbreaking work during his tenure at the prestigious Sloan-Kettering Institute in New York City."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 367, "end": 566, "text": "Sentelhas, a Brazilian-born scientist, spent nearly a decade at the esteemed research institute, where he made significant contributions to the understanding and treatment of various types of cancer."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 567, "end": 682, "text": "His work focused on developing novel therapeutic approaches, including targeted gene therapies and immunotherapies."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 683, "end": 850, "text": "\"I was drawn to Sloan-Kettering's commitment to pushing the boundaries of cancer research,\" Sentelhas said in an interview at his current laboratory in Rio de Janeiro."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 851, "end": 1024, "text": "\"The institute's collaborative environment and cutting-edge facilities allowed me to explore innovative ideas and collaborate with some of the brightest minds in the field.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1025, "end": 1227, "text": "During his time at Sloan-Kettering, Sentelhas was part of a team that published several seminal papers in top-tier scientific journals, including the New England Journal of Medicine and Nature Medicine."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1228, "end": 1405, "text": "One of his most notable contributions was the discovery of a novel biomarker for early-stage lung cancer, which has since become a standard diagnostic tool in clinical practice."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1406, "end": 1460, "text": "\"Paulo was an invaluable member of our team,\" said Dr."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1461, "end": 1560, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, a former colleague and current director of the institute's Cancer Biology Program."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1561, "end": 1675, "text": "\"His passion for research and his ability to think outside the box were instrumental in driving our work forward.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1676, "end": 1932, "text": "According to data from the National Institutes of Health, Sentelhas' research during his time at Sloan-Kettering led to a significant increase in funding for cancer research, with grants totaling over $10 million awarded to the institute during his tenure."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1933, "end": 2014, "text": "Sentelhas' work has also had a lasting impact on the global scientific community."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2015, "end": 2147, "text": "His research has been cited over 1,000 times, and he has been invited to present his findings at numerous international conferences."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2148, "end": 2370, "text": "When asked about his decision to leave Sloan-Kettering, Sentelhas cited a desire to return to his native Brazil and establish a research center focused on addressing the unique challenges of cancer in developing countries."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2371, "end": 2509, "text": "\"I'm proud of the work we accomplished at Sloan-Kettering, but I feel a deep responsibility to give back to my community,\" Sentelhas said."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Universidade de Santo Amaro", "Sloan-Kettering Institute"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Universidade de Santo Amaro", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Sloan-Kettering Institute", "origin": "initial"}]}

